{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 73,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.08282470703125,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "tiveness of various topical antibiotics. There is low-moderate quality evidence that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0729064941406,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "topical quinolones are better than topical non-quinolones at reducing discharge at",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.9377136230469,
        85.52207946777344,
        399.0476379394531,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        348.40289306640625,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "2–3 weeks, but there was no significant difference in discharge at 1 week (",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.52207946777344,
        80.54290771484375,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "A7.20",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.26170349121094,
        98.74208068847656,
        88.04170989990234,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1014404296875,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "There was moderate quality evidence that improvement in hearing thresholds is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0829772949219,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "better with topical quinolone when compared to topical antiseptics or no treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        396.79290771484375,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "The review of topical antibiotics included 14 trials (1724 ears). Study quality was low-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.10284423828125,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "moderate and definitions of CSOM varied, with some studies including children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.0928039550781,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with otitis externa and mastoid cavity infections. There is moderate quality evidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.09283447265625,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "that topical quinolone antibiotics were better than no treatment in preventing the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        324.50439453125,
        189.52210998535156,
        399.0442810058594,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        324.9327392578125,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "persistence of discharge at 1 week (RR 0.83, 95% CI 0.76 to 0.89) (",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.52210998535156,
        80.06290435791016,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "A7.21",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.38870239257812,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0787658691406,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "). One study in Malawi [Macfadyn, 2005] compared hearing thresholds for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.1228942871094,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "children treated with ciprofloxacin versus boric acid and showed a difference in mean",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.1026611328125,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "59 improvement of 2.17db (95% CI 0.09 to 4.24) at 2 weeks, and 3.43 (95% CI 1.34 to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        226.4729766845703,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "5.52) at 4 weeks in favour of ciprofloxacin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.0913391113281,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "The review of systemic versus topical antibiotics included 8 trials (474 participants).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.12286376953125,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "The definition of CSOM varied between studies. Study quality ranged from very low",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.1429748535156,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "to moderate, with most studies having inadequate allocation concealment and no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.11285400390625,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "blinding. There was moderate quality evidence for higher rates of treatment failure",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.0728759765625,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with systemic antibiotics compared to topical quinolone antibiotics. There was no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.0729675292969,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "significant difference in treatment failure between systemic non-quinolone and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.0228271484375,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "topical non-quinolones antibiotics (very low quality evidence), or systemic antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        267.78448486328125,
        345.5220947265625,
        351.494384765625,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table 22",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        361.19561767578125,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and topical antiseptics (moderate quality evidence) ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        370.2607116699219,
        166.46292114257812,
        382.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "8.3.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        398.0453796386719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.9153747558594,
        399.07293701171875,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Topical quinolone antibiotics reduce persistent discharge, hearing thresholds",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.9153747558594,
        94.92288970947266,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "improve.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        433.4093017578125,
        81.16291046142578,
        445.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        446.4192810058594,
        312.55291748046875,
        459.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Local discomfort, opportunistic fungal infection. [WHO 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        470.9378967285156,
        207.81297302246094,
        482.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "8.3.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        486.59246826171875,
        399.0629577636719,
        500.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "Ear drops are easy to apply by health workers and caregivers, requiring minimal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        499.4624938964844,
        399.1219787597656,
        513.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "Model Formulary for Children training. Topical ciprofloxacin is in the WHO   [WHO",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.5924682617188,
        303.3329162597656,
        526.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "2010]. Cost is US$ 1.00 for a 10 ml bottle. [MSH/WHO 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.14013671875,
        374.7360534667969,
        549.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "8.4\t Topical antiseptics for treatment of Chronic Suppurative Otitis",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        549.14013671875,
        157.43470764160156,
        562.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "Media (CSOM)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        565.7658081054688,
        399.0429382324219,
        579.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "Topical antiseptics and steroids should not be used for the treatment of chronic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.7658081054688,
        242.9529266357422,
        592.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "suppurative otitis media (CSOM) in children.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        594.17041015625,
        252.91282653808594,
        608.0903930664062
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4416046142578,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.6046142578125,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "59",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}